# Plugin count fixture — dev-tools.env
#
# Synthetic stand-in. The real file carries "replaces all 13 static skills"
# and "replaces all 11 default agents" within ten lines of the plugin
# literal, which is why the scan's regex is narrow. Both decoys are
# reproduced here, so a loosened regex fails against this fixture the same
# way it would against the real doc.

# CLAUDE_PLUGINS replaces all 7 defaults
# CLAUDE_SKILLS replaces all 13 static skills
# CLAUDE_AGENTS replaces all 11 default agents
